  "steps": [
    "Grind the suji lightly in a mixer. Add salt and water gradually to make a soft dough. Rest for 10–15 minutes.",
    "Place the carrot, cabbage, capsicum and onion in a clean cloth and squeeze out the excess water.",
    "Boil the soya chunks, squeeze out all the water, dry them well and grind them coarsely.",
    "Mix the vegetables, soya chunks, paneer, sweet corn, green chilli, oregano, chilli flakes, black pepper and salt.",
    "Roll the dough into a thin sheet and cut out small round wrappers using a round cutter or bowl.",
    "Add the filling, fold and seal into momos.",
    "Grease the steaming plate with ghee and place the momos on it.",
    "Steam for 10 minutes or until cooked through.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
